if; line-height: normal; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -18pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -18pt;\">1. 기초학력 증진 상세 안내 및 매뉴얼 페이지 <b>[첨부파일 참고]</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; line-height: normal; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(154, 165, 234);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://sugar-action-c4f.notion.site/X-2026-2-3cdf8e0493c980e69956cdb803143085#3cdf8e0493c98091930cd311aa71d31b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">페이지바로가기</a></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">※확인하지 않아 발생하는</span><b style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> 불이익에 대해 책임지지 않으니</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">한번 더 안내문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">매뉴얼 등 확인 및 숙지 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2. </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">기초학력 증진 프로그램 인증여부 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">매주 금요일 확인 후 → 월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">화요일 중 인증여부 개별 안내 예정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">금오공대 앱 알림</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">3. 인증혜택 및 미인증 유의사항</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- 인증혜택 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">BISKIT </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">마일리지 지급</span></span></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">미 인증시</span>: 다음학기 프로그램 자동연장, (연장기한: 인증 시 까지)</span></b></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4.</span></span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">접속방법</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-학교홈페이지 원킷 로그인 →'기초학력 증진' 클릭</span></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>온라인 보완학습 이수시간은 9월 14일 (월) 증진 프로그램 시작 시점부터 인정</b></span>됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">-1학기 참여 시간은 인정되지 아니합니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">5. </span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>본인 점수 확인방법</b></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;1) 학교 포털(Onekit) 접속 → 통합정보시스템 클릭&nbsp; → 학적 클릭&nbsp; → 학적부정보관리(학생) → 제일 뒷쪽 '기초학력평가' 탭 클릭&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;→ 점수 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;2) 학교홈페이지 원킷 로그인 →기초학력 증진' 클릭 → 진단평가 결과 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; ▶ 기초학력 증진 사이트 첫 접속 시 로그인 정보 확인을 위해 로딩시간(10초 이상)이 다소 소요됨을 양해 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">6. 2025학년도 최종 미인증자는 2026학년도 2학기 운영시 자동 연장되어 운영됩니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
